  "content": "<p>这是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Exposure</a>模组的配套扩展，新增内容让原模组功能更完善。</p>\n\n<h3>望远镜头与全景镜头</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fb757b2dc53999d832b532e542cde49c47769ae5_0.webp\" alt=\"望远镜头\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/40347126a285bb32870b52e31776a1c893b6389e_0.webp\" alt=\"全景镜头\"></p>\n<p>使用望远镜和紫水晶合成望远镜头可实现超远距变焦，全景镜头则能扩大取景范围拍摄更广阔区域。</p>\n\n<h3>复古胶片</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/657b235a4721dbb7349140755e9bbe9c70675f84_0.webp\" alt=\"Gameboy胶片\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b4e837bba986be5ae84631bd11a18737ed816f6d_0.webp\" alt=\"NES胶片\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5a89a0915822717816c2d620bfb92efb87cdea33_0.webp\" alt=\"Commodore 64胶片\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/840cadca9db1ef90e534be217fb98209488dfb9c_0.webp\" alt=\"CGA胶片\"></p>\n<p>Gameboy、NES、Commodore 64和CGA调色板风格的复古胶片，可在村庄宝箱中找到或像其他滤镜一样合成。</p>\n\n<h3>高容量与高分辨率胶片</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7d60845ddd701a6b8addb2f7f10daccb7fa25ce7_0.webp\" alt=\"高容量彩色胶片\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ad503ff44a79242be81731542f3afa47b5a73f9f_0.webp\" alt=\"高分辨率彩色胶片\"></p>\n<p>提供双倍拍摄张量的高容量胶片，以及双倍画质的高分辨率胶片。这些胶片适用于所有相机，均提供彩色与黑白版本。</p>\n\n<h3>特效滤镜</h3>\n<p>基于超级秘密设置着色器的16种精美相机滤镜，可在各类建筑结构的宝箱中发现。</p>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure-polaroid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Exposure Polaroid</a> 联动</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/78945a5f8249652bec64d5be853b481d791d448d_0.webp\" alt=\"即时Gameboy相纸\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/646d8dd1324497db6c6df6bb1818e8047b47d126_0.webp\" alt=\"即时高分辨率彩色相纸\"></p>\n<p>安装Exposure Polaroid模组后，所有即时相机均可使用复古相纸和高分辨率相纸进行拍摄。</p>\n\n<p>访问<a href=\"https://github.com/Sparkwave2/exposure-expanded/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基页面</a>获取更多信息，或加入<a href=\"https://discord.gg/abWNXyudA5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord服务器</a>提问与建议。</p>",
